response:
To create a web page that displays an image with a caption underneath it using HTML and CSS, follow these steps:

1. Create an HTML file (e.g., `image_with_caption.html`) and add the following code:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title>Image with Caption</title>
    <style>
      #img-container {
        text-align: center;
      }
      #img-container img {
        max-width: 100%;
        height: auto;
      }
      #img-container p {
        margin: 0;
        font-style: italic;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="img-container">
      <a href="http://www.example.com"><img src="image.jpg" alt="Image"></a>
      <p>Caption goes here</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
