3. Timeline

The estimated timeframe for the manufacture and delivery of the Products shall be as follows:

a. [Start Date]: The date on which Manufacturer will begin manufacturing the Products;
b. [Delivery Date]: The date on which Manufacturer will deliver the Products to Client;

4. Quality Standards

Manufacturer shall ensure that the Products meet or exceed the quality standards and requirements specified by Client. Manufacturer shall conduct thorough quality control checks throughout the manufacturing process to ensure that the Products meet these standards.

5. Pricing

The price for the Products shall be determined based on the following factors:

a. The quantity of Products ordered;
b. The complexity of the Products;
c. The materials and components used;
d. The labor costs associated with the manufacturing process;
e. Any other relevant factors deemed appropriate by the parties.

6. Payment Terms

Client shall pay Manufacturer the agreed-upon price for the Products

