This program takes the number of each product and their respective prices as input, then calculates the total cost by adding up the costs of each product. The result is printed to the console.

To run this program, save it as a `.java` file (e.g., `ProductCost.java`) and compile it using the Java compiler:

```
javac ProductCost.java
